---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Ironman Guide - a practical OSRS resource for Standard Ironman players."
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content">
        <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'About' }]} />

        <h1>About Ironman Guide</h1>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2>What this site is</h2>
          <p>
            Ironman Guide is a curated resource for OSRS Ironman players. We focus on practical, opinionated guidance that tells you <strong>what to do and when</strong> — not a wiki-style data dump of every possible option.
          </p>
          <p>
            The site is primarily aimed at <strong>Standard Ironman</strong> accounts, with Hardcore safety notes included where relevant. UIM and GIM content may come in the future.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2>Our approach</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Opinionated:</strong> We make recommendations rather than listing every alternative without guidance.</li>
            <li><strong>Practical:</strong> Methods that actually work, written like advice from a mate who's done the grind.</li>
            <li><strong>Current:</strong> Guides are updated for game changes. We link out to the wiki and YouTube for raw data and visuals.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2>What this site isn't</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>A wiki competitor — we link to the wiki for drop tables and raw data</li>
            <li>A video platform — we link to creators for visual guides</li>
            <li>A generic gaming blog</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2>Who's behind this</h2>
          <p>
            Just an ironman who wanted a better reference than scattered Reddit threads and outdated YouTube videos. If you have feedback or spot something wrong, the best way to help is to let us know.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .about-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-section ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about-section li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }
</style>
